cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this paper or software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Exploiting Low-Dimensional Manifold Structure for Archival Compression of High-Dimensional ML Embeddings: A Dynamical Systems Approach"
version: 1.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.17680988
date-released: "2026-04-24"
url: "https://github.com/Yatrogenesis/Embedding-Manifold-Compression"
